{"skill":{"slug":"akshare-stock","displayName":"A股量化 AkShare"},"version":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1772461532238,"changelog":"- Added a new \"备选方案: Baostock\" section with example code for using baostock if AkShare installation fails.\n- Updated \"注意事项\" to include a note about potential network issues and testing in the local environment.\n- No changes to skill functionality or API usage; documentation improvement only.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2890,"sha256":"eaf0dfd766c0fef85f37c06f4856f1f0addb943716ddad0b7141d2fa1986d503","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/stock_cli.py","size":3578,"sha256":"7ce250f9921f0d0ecee0a74c36ad577970370402af31dbb3088fcce9e29eee14","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2346,"sha256":"d659200732f09245669fc6476699275bfab7e2871fd54f3eeaf69aee0e2e8ee9","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789097419428,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7b87b0dc68a34b69dd10a185fdf5abf24c072dbb55fa6f8129303b82d0e98387","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7b87b0dc68a34b69dd10a185fdf5abf24c072dbb55fa6f8129303b82d0e98387","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085618399},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":51,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":4,"checkedAt":1789097419428},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward China A-share market data helper, with some quality and dependency caveats but no evidence of hidden, destructive, persistent, or deceptive behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access to market data providers is expected for this purpose, and the code does not read local files, credentials, browser profiles, or broad private content. Users should treat returned financial data as informational only.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill asks users to run an unpinned `pip install akshare`, which is a normal but reproducibility-sensitive dependency pattern. There is no bundled installer, remote payload execution instruction, or privileged install requirement.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions stay within stock data lookup and examples. I found no prompt hijacking, role changes, hidden evaluator instructions, tool spoofing, or unrelated agent behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifacts do not create persistence, scheduled tasks, background workers, privilege escalation, credential storage, or local configuration changes beyond a user-directed package install.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is A-share market data access using AkShare, and the artifacts mostly align with quote, historical price, sector, fund-flow, and search workflows. The documentation overstates some capabilities such as financial analysis and stock screening, and one fund-flow function appears broken, but this is a functionality mismatch rather than a security concern.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install this only in an isolated Python environment, preferably with reviewed pinned versions of dependencies. Expect it to make network requests to retrieve A-share market data. Be aware that some advertised features appear incomplete or broken, and the skill should not be treated as investment advice.","findings":"[TP4] unexpected: The advertised financial analysis and screening capabilities are not implemented in the CLI, and fund-flow handling appears incomplete. This supports a quality/disclosure caveat, not tool poisoning or malicious behavior.\n[SQP-3] expected: The SKILL.md content is Chinese-only, but the subject is China A-share workflows and the purpose is clear from the title and description. This is a localization limitation rather than a security issue.\n[SQP-3] expected: The CLI help and errors are Chinese-only, matching the China A-share target user context. Users who need English output may find it unsuitable, but it does not create high-impact risk.\n[SDI-4] unexpected: The script calls `stock_individual_fund_flow(...)` without the imported `ak.` namespace, so that action likely fails. This is a bug in a declared feature, not evidence of hidden behavior.\n[T08] expected: The unpinned AkShare dependency is a real supply-chain hygiene issue, but third-party package use is expected for an AkShare-based stock data skill and is user-directed.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789097419428}}}}}